./","meaning":"听听他们的谈话","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s002.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s004","speaker":"narrator","text":"Then correct the false one(s).","rects":[{"x":51.0468,"y":12.225,"w":25.1075,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈðen kəˈrekt ðə ˈfɔːls ˈwʌn ˈes)./","meaning":"然后纠正错误的。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s004.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s005","speaker":"narrator","text":"1 David is celebrating the Lantern Festival right now.","rects":[{"x":18.2624,"y":23.7269,"w":51.7869,"h":1.771}],"ipa":"/ˈwʌn ˈdeɪvɪd ɪz ˈseləˌbreɪtɪŋ ðə ˈlæntən ˈfestɪvəl ˈraɪt ˈnaʊ./","meaning":"1大卫正在庆祝灯光节","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s005.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s006","speaker":"narrator","text":"2 Emily knows a lot about the Lantern Festival.","rects":[{"x":18.2624,"y":26.8664,"w":46.2034,"h":1.771}],"ipa":"/ˈtuː ˈnəʊz ə ˈlɒt əˈbaʊt ðə ˈlæntən ˈfestɪvəl./","meaning":"2艾米莉对灯光节了解甚多。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s006.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s007","speaker":"narrator","text":"3 David enjoys the Lantern Festival.","rects":[{"x":18.2624,"y":30.0058,"w":35.4246,"h":1.771}],"ipa":"/ˈθriː ˈdeɪvɪd ɪˈndʒɔɪz ðə ˈlæntən ˈfestɪvəl./","meaning":"3，大卫享受灯光节。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s007.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s020","speaker":"narrator","text":"David does not watch lion dance shows during the","rects":[{"x":20.921,"y":33.1453,"w":48.9301,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈdeɪvɪd ˈdʌz ˌnɒt ˈwɒtʃ ˈlaɪən ˈdɑːns ˈʃəʊz ˈdjʊərɪŋ ðə/","meaning":"大卫不看狮子舞表演","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s020.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s008","speaker":"narrator","text":"Lantern Festival.","rects":[{"x":20.921,"y":35.532,"w":15.8958,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈlæntən ˈfestɪvəl./","meaning":"绿灯节。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s008.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s009","speaker":"narrator","text":"5 Emily wants to celebrate the Lantern Festival.","rects":[{"x":18.2624,"y":38.6714,"w":46.3933,