a","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s026.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s025","speaker":"narrator","text":"yuanxiao","rects":[{"x":34.7736,"y":60.3837,"w":8.4547,"h":1.7302}],"ipa":"/jwen ʃaʊ/","meaning":"元宵","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s025.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s027","speaker":"narrator","text":"Information","rects":[{"x":14.6649,"y":64.0717,"w":12.585,"h":1.7433}],"ipa":"/ˌɪnfəˈmeɪʃən/","meaning":"资料","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s027.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s012","speaker":"narrator","text":"It’s a type of rice ball.","rects":[{"x":34.7736,"y":64.0761,"w":20.5133,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɪts ə ˈtaɪp ɒv ˈraɪs ˈbɔːl./","meaning":"这是米球的一种。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s012.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s028","speaker":"narrator","text":"It’s","rects":[{"x":55.8793,"y":64.0761,"w":2.7841,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɪts/","meaning":"这是","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s028.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s013","speaker":"narrator","text":"It’s round.","rects":[{"x":61.7022,"y":64.0761,"w":9.8521,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɪts ˈraʊnd./","meaning":"这是圆的。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s013.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s029","speaker":"narrator","text":"There’s usually a","rects":[{"x":72.1467,"y":64.0761,"w":15.8337,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌðeəz ˈjuːʒʊəliː ə/","meaning":"通常有一个","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s029.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s030","speaker":"narrator","text":"about the food","rects":[{"x":14.6649,"y":66.4584,"w":15.0124,"h":1.7433}],"ipa":"/əˈbaʊt ðə ˈfuːd/","meaning":"关于食物","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s030.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s014","speaker":"narrator","text":"round.","rects":[{"x":34.7736,"y":66.4628,"w":6.4752,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈraʊnd./","meaning":"圆曰。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s014.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s015","speaker":"narrator","text":"It’s usually sweet.","rects":[{"x":41.8412,"y":66.4628,"w":16.6903,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɪts ˈjuːʒʊəliː ˈswiːt./","meaning":"这通常很温馨。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s015.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s016","speaker":"narrator","text":"beautiful design on it.","rects":[{"x":61.7022,"y":66.4628,"w":21.1346,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈbjuːtɪfʊl dɪˈzaɪn ˌɒn ɪt./","meaning":"上面有漂亮的设计","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s016.wav"},{"id":"u18-p128-s017","speaker":"narrator","text":"Meaning Families get together.","rects":[{"x":14.6649,"y":70.1727,"w":8.9645,"h":1.7433},{"x":34.7736,"y":70.177,"w":20.4305,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈmiːnɪŋ ˈfæmɪliːz get təˈgeðə./","meaning":"意思是家人会聚在一起","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p128-s017.wav"}]},{"page":129,"pdfPage":130,"width":532.9130249023438,"height":754.0159912109375,"image":"assets/pages/page-129.webp","sentences":[{"id":"u18-p129-s022","speaker":"narrator","text":"Unit 8","rects":[{"x":84.4168,"y":3.6233,"w":6.0077,"h":1.8477}],"ipa":"/ˈjuːnɪt ˈeɪt/","meaning":"第8单元","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s022.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s023","speaker":"narrator","text":"C Behind the festivals","rects":[{"x":12.0053,"y":6.4851,"w":32.9688,"h":2.6041}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː bɪˈhaɪnd ðə ˈfestɪvəlz/","meaning":"C在节日后面","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s023.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s002","speaker":"narrator","text":"Read it with her and complete the sentences below.","rects":[{"x":61.4184,"y":10.2356,"w":26.3183,"h":2.0721},{"x":12.0052,"y":12.225,"w":18.1626,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈriːd ɪt wɪð hɜː ænd kəˈmpliːt ðə ˈsentənsɪz bɪˈləʊ./","meaning":"和她一起读，然后完成下面的句子。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s002.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s001","speaker":"narrator","text":"C1 Nora is reading an article about the Spring Festival.","rects":[{"x":12.7669,"y":10.2356,"w":48.1966,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː ˈwʌn ˈnɔːrə ɪz ˈriːdɪŋ ən ˈɑːtɪkəl əˈbaʊt ðə ˈsprɪŋ ˈfestɪvəl./","meaning":"C1 Nora正在读一篇关于春节的文章。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s001.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s024","speaker":"narrator","text":"The Spring Festival:","rects":[{"x":35.2094,"y":16.4274,"w":29.2532,"h":3.5546}],"ipa":"/ðə ˈsprɪŋ ˈfestɪvəl:/","meaning":"春节:","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s024.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s025","speaker":"narrator","text":"WON","rects":[{"x":13.8039,"y":17.142,"w":8.6434,"h":4.2984}],"ipa":"/ˈwʌn/","meaning":"吴","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s025.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s026","speaker":"narrator","text":"WON","rects":[{"x":76.6655,"y":18.3715,"w":8.0399,"h":3.2797}],"ipa":"/ˈwʌn/","meaning":"吴","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s026.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s027","speaker":"narrator","text":"more than celebrations","rects":[{"x":32.1467,"y":19.2921,"w":35.3822,"h":3.5546}],"ipa":"/ˈmɔː ðən ˌselɪˈbreɪʃənz/","meaning":"不只是庆祝","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s027.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s003","speaker":"narrator","text":"The Spring Festival is the most important festival for Chinese people.","rects":[{"x":15.3314,"y":24.0477,"w":63.3563,"h":1.6281}],"ipa":"/ðə ˈsprɪŋ ˈfestɪvəl ɪz ðə ˈməʊst ɪˈmpɔːtənt ˈfestɪvəl fɔː ˌtʃaɪˈniːz ˈpiːpəl./","meaning":"春节是中国人民最重要的节日。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s003.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s004","speaker":"narrator","text":"Many Chinese people travel a long way home for it.","rects":[{"x":79.3172,"y":24.0477,"w":4.7021,"h":1.6281},{"x":15.3314,"y":26.0376,"w":41.4559,"h":1.6281}],"ipa":"/ˈmeniː ˌtʃaɪˈniːz ˈpiːpəl ˈtrævəl ə ˈlɒŋ ˈweɪ ˈhəʊm fɔː ɪt./","meaning":"许多中国人为此远道而来。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s004.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s005","speaker":"narrator","text":"There are many wonderful ways to celebrate the Spring Festival.","rects":[{"x":15.3314,"y":28.7788,"w":58.7141,"h":1.6281}],"ipa":"/ˌðeə ɑː ˈmeniː ˈwʌndəfʊl ˈweɪz tə ˈselɪbreɪt ðə ˈsprɪŋ ˈfestɪvəl./","meaning":"庆祝春节有多种奇妙的方法。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s005.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s006","speaker":"narrator","text":"People enjoy big family dinners.","rects":[{"x":74.675,"y":28.7788,"w":11.7593,"h":1.6281},{"x":15.3314,"y":30.7687,"w":16.7999,"h":1.6281}],"ipa":"/ˈpiːpəl ɪˈndʒɔɪ ˈbɪg ˈfæmɪliː ˈdɪnəz./","meaning":"人们喜欢吃大家庭晚餐。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s006.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s007","speaker":"narrator","text":"Elder relatives often give lucky money to young people.","rects":[{"x":32.7608,"y":30.7687,"w":51.0933,"h":1.6281}],"ipa":"/ˈeldə ˈrelətɪvz ˈɒfən ˈgɪv ˈlʌkiː ˈmʌniː tə ˈjʌŋ ˈpiːpəl./","meaning":"年长的亲戚经常给年轻人送幸运钱。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s007.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s008","speaker":"narrator","text":"Families also watch fireworks and festival shows together.","rects":[{"x":15.3314,"y":32.7586,"w":52.8643,"h":1.6281}],"ipa":"/ˈfæmɪliːz ˈɔːlsəʊ ˈwɒtʃ ˈfaɪəwɜːks ænd ˈfestɪvəl ˈʃəʊz təˈgeðə./","meaning":"家庭也一起观看烟花和节日表演。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s008.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s009","speaker":"narrator","text":"The Spring Festival is about more than just celebrations.","rects":[{"x":15.3314,"y":35.4998,"w":51.6589,"h":1.6281}],"ipa":"/ðə ˈsprɪŋ ˈfestɪvəl ɪz əˈbaʊt ˈmɔː ðən ˈdʒʌst ˌselɪˈbreɪʃənz./","meaning":"春节不只是庆祝而已","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s009.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s010","speaker":"narrator","text":"It is about the Chinese culture of family.","rects":[{"x":67.6198,"y":35.4998,"w":12.6696,"h":1.6281},{"x":15.3314,"y":37.4896,"w":23.2792,"h":1.6281}],"ipa":"/ˌɪt ɪz əˈbaʊt ðə ˌtʃaɪˈniːz ˈkʌltʃə ɒv ˈfæmɪliː./","meaning":"这是关于中国家庭文化的。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s010.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s011","speaker":"narrator","text":"The festival encourages people to spend time with their families.","rects":[{"x":39.2401,"y":37.4896,"w":46.2777,"h":1.6281},{"x":15.3314,"y":39.4795,"w":12.3827,"h":1.6281}],"ipa":"/ðə ˈfestɪvəl ɪˈnkʌrɪdʒɪz ˈpiːpəl tə ˈspend ˈtaɪm wɪð ðeə ˈfæmɪliːz./","meaning":"节日鼓励人们与家人共度时光。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s011.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s012","speaker":"narrator","text":"It helps family members connect and build strong ties with each other.","rects":[{"x":28.3436,"y":39.4795,"w":58.8297,"h":1.6281},{"x":15.3314,"y":41.4694,"w":5.4472,"h":1.6281}],"ipa":"/ˌɪt ˈhelps ˈfæmɪliː ˈmembəz kəˈnekt ænd ˈbɪld ˈstrɒŋ ˈtaɪz wɪð ˈiːtʃ ˈʌðə./","meaning":"它帮助家庭成员互相联系和建立牢固的联系。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s012.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s013","speaker":"narrator","text":"The Spring Festival has a special place in the hearts of Chinese people.","rects":[{"x":21.4081,"y":41.4694,"w":65.1934,"h":1.6281}],"ipa":"/ðə ˈsprɪŋ ˈfestɪvəl hæz ə ˈspeʃl ˈpleɪs ɪn ðə ˈhɑːts ɒv ˌtʃaɪˈniːz ˈpiːpəl./","meaning":"春节在中国人民的心中占有特殊的地位。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s013.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s014","speaker":"narrator","text":"1 The Spring Festival is festival in China.","rects":[{"x":13.8039,"y":47.8811,"w":22.9221,"h":1.7711},{"x":73.8906,"y":47.8811,"w":16.5337,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈwʌn ðə ˈsprɪŋ ˈfestɪvəl ɪz ˈfestɪvəl ɪn ˈtʃaɪnə./","meaning":"1 春节节是中国的节日。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s014.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s015","speaker":"narrator","text":"2 Millions of people home for it.","rects":[{"x":13.8018,"y":50.2459,"w":20.1603,"h":1.7711},{"x":78.9539,"y":50.2459,"w":11.4683,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈtuː ˈmɪljənz ɒv ˈpiːpəl ˈhəʊm fɔː ɪt./","meaning":"2百万人因此归家。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s015.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s016","speaker":"narrator","text":"3 People enjoy.","rects":[{"x":13.7998,"y":52.6107,"w":14.9959,"h":1.7711},{"x":89.8278,"y":52.6107,"w":0.5924,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈθriː ˈpiːpəl ɪˈndʒɔɪ./","meaning":"3人们享受。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u18/u18-p129-s016.wav"},{"id":"u18-p129-s017","speaker":"narrator","text":"4 Young peopl